    "detailed_description": "<h1>Other shmup games</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660850/extras/b524bc4cbbb1e544898384dfe1a32dc4.poster.avif?t=1721697343\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660850/extras/b524bc4cbbb1e544898384dfe1a32dc4.webm?t=1721697343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660850/extras/b524bc4cbbb1e544898384dfe1a32dc4.mp4?t=1721697343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Story:</strong><br>In a quiet room, a man's eyes fall upon an intriguing weight loss program advertisement. Promising simplicity and effortless results, the program's tagline echoes in his mind: &quot;Eat, Play, Lose Weight.&quot; Intrigued and hopeful, he places an order.<br><br>As the package arrives at his doorstep, anticipation fills the air. Opening it, he discovers a unique twist\u2014a program that requires him to consume a ship, becoming a participant in a bizarre video game-like experience. With each level, he gains control over the vessel, venturing into the depths of his own body to confront and obliterate peculiar creatures lurking within.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D side-scrolling shmup: Engage in a gorgeous shoot 'em-up adventure as you navigate visually stunning environments.<br></li><li>Hand-drawn art style with flesh/gore theme: Immerse yourself in a surreal world brought to life through meticulously crafted hand-drawn artwork, combining beauty with grotesque elements.<br></li><li>Bullet hell: Test your reflexes and strategic thinking in intense battles against relentless waves of enemies and intricate bullet patterns.</li></ul><br>Unleash your skills, dodge relentless barrages, and uncover the mysteries hidden within 